      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "The town’s name comes from mineral springs that drew visitors in the 19th century, turning Estill Springs into a modest spa destination.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        19
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Estill_Springs%2C_Tennessee",
      "category": "etymology",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "Early visitors noted the springs’ mix of sulfur, chalybeate, limestone, and freestone waters, believed to have healing properties.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
